The invariant epsilon tensor makes the singlet construction transparent. For $SU(2)$, $\epsilon_{ij}U^i{}_kU^j{}_\ell
=(\det U)\epsilon_{k\ell}
=\epsilon_{k\ell}.$ Therefore $\epsilon_{ij}\psi^i\phi^j$ is invariant. For $SU(3)$, the three-index version gives $\epsilon_{ijk}U^i{}_aU^j{}_bU^k{}_c
=(\det U)\epsilon_{abc}
=\epsilon_{abc},$ which proves the invariance of the three-quark state in Equation [eq:l4-baryon-singlet].

